Cossacks!" Laurie jumped up and pulled an imaginary sword from her

40
00:04:32.675 --> 00:04:41.159
hip. "Right!" said Grandpa. "Luckily for Ivan, those wild horsemen lived right on the Russian

41
00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:45.609
borders. 'Cossack' comes from a word meaning free

42
00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:51.998
man. These men were considered free because they didn't belong to any of the states in the

43
