area. This meant they didn't follow any ruler's laws and didn't pay taxes to

44
00:04:58.318 --> 00:05:06.675
anyone. That probably doesn't sound like much to you, Laurie," Grandpa added, "but to adults that is a very big

45
00:05:06.676 --> 00:05:13.545
deal. "Anyway, these Cossacks were usually peasant men who had left their original

46
00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:21.074
villages. They didn't like what life there had to offer them—most peasants in the Middle Ages lived practically as

47
00:05:21.075 --> 00:05:29.614
slaves. Out in the wild steppes, they became strong and excellent fighters—exactly what Ivan the Terrible

48
00:05:29.615 --> 00:05:33.641
needed. He hired these Cossacks to fight the

49
00:05:33.642 --> 00:05:39.733
Mongols. In exchange he promised to pay them and grant them continued

50
