independence. From then on the Cossacks became known as mercenaries. Do you know what a mercenary

51
00:05:47.422 --> 00:05:49.646
is?" Laurie shook her

52
00:05:49.647 --> 00:05:54.201
head. "A mercenary is someone who fights for

53
